ind":"announcement","title":"1000 wishlists, thank you!","summary":"Thank you to everyone who stopped by the shop during Next Fest. Yokai Mart just passed 1000 wishlists! Obachan would bow, but her back hurts. Here’s what we’re working on now: At least three more yokai with their own stories More choices and customer stories The demo stays available, so if a friend hasn’t tried it yet, now’s a good time. See you in the store! Dominik & Oli","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:08:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032380","verified_at":"2026-10-22T16:55:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4869400-1846651706681624","game_id":"steam-4869400","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.4.5","summary":"Hey everyone!Steam Next Fest is just around the corner, and we’ve been busy polishing the demo to make sure it’s in the best shape possible. Here’s what’s new:End-of-day statistics screenNotebook pages for your regular customersPickup station and cashier employeeReworked decision screenImproved translationsVarious bugfixes and quality of life improvementsNext Fest starts October 19th. We’d love your support! If you’re enjoying what you see, spread the word and help us reach more players. Every w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:09:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681624","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4869400-1844751498218209","game_id":"steam-4869400","kind":"announcement","title":"Yokai Mart runs on Steam Deck","summary":"Dear friends,Great news! Yokai Mart runs beautifully on Steam Deck! We test every build directly on device, and the experience feels right at home on the handheld.Official Steam Deck verification is on our roadmap closer to full release. But if you want to play on the go, you're good to go.We're also putting the finishing touches on our Next Fest build, which brings new mechanics and a smoother overall experience. Can't wait for you to try it.Thank you for your support! More updates soon!Dominik","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T11:57:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218209","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4869400-1843481262704797","game_id":"steam-4869400","kind":"announcement","title":"Yokai Mart - Demo","summary":"Obachan has handed you the keys to her little konbini. The shelves need stocking, the regulars have opinions, and after dark, not every customer is human. The Yokai Mart demo is free to play on Steam right now. What's in the demoTake over the shop as AoiStock shelves, serve customers and keep the konbini runningMeet the regulars, like Rin, Ayame, Endo and MakotoEncounter your first yokai and find out what it wantsFill your notebook with everything you learn about the people (and spirits) who wal","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T14:54:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704797","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4869400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:29Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:25Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4869400":"2026-10-26T04:48:29Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4869400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:25Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5003860":{"last_attempt_at":"2